@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
    ViewData["MetaDescription"] = "How ApplyWise handles account details, resumes, applications, and connected Google data.";
}
<section class="public-info-card">
    <span class="eyebrow">Privacy policy</span>
    <h1>Your job search belongs to you.</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated: August 12, 2026.</strong> This policy explains how the ApplyWise operator collects, uses, stores, and deletes information when you use ApplyWise.</p>
    <div class="public-info-grid">
        <div><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>Account and profile details, uploaded resumes, applications, interviews, analysis results, job-post checks, security records, and basic product-usage events needed to operate and protect the service.</p></div>
        <div><h2>How it is used</h2><p>To provide your private workspace, analyze resumes, track applications, secure accounts, diagnose failures, prevent abuse, and improve product reliability. ApplyWise does not sell personal information.</p></div>
        <div><h2>Private files</h2><p>Uploaded resumes are stored outside the public web root and returned only after authentication and an ownership check. Resume analysis uses local, explainable rules and does not send resume text to a paid AI service in this release.</p></div>
        <div><h2>Connected Google data</h2><p>If you voluntarily connect Google, ApplyWise uses Google sign-in details and, when separately authorized, read-only Gmail access to identify application-status messages. Protected tokens are retained until you disconnect or delete your account. Google data is not used for advertising.</p></div>
        <div><h2>Service providers</h2><p>The deployed service may use a hosting provider, managed SQL storage, private file storage, and an email-delivery provider. Google processes data only when you choose a Google feature. These providers process information to deliver the service.</p></div>
        <div><h2>Retention and deletion</h2><p>Your workspace data is retained while your account remains open. Operational product events are automatically removed after 90 days. Account deletion removes database records and queues private resume files for deletion, subject to limited backup-retention and legal obligations.</p></div>
        <div><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can correct profile and workspace records, disconnect Google, or permanently delete your account from Settings. To request access to a copy of your information or ask a privacy question, contact the address below.</p></div>
        <div><h2>Security and transfers</h2><p>ApplyWise uses account isolation, access controls, encrypted transport, rate limits, and protected credentials. No internet service can guarantee absolute security. Depending on provider locations, information may be processed outside your country.</p></div>
        <div><h2>Children</h2><p>ApplyWise is intended for people managing a professional job search and is not directed to children under 13. Do not submit another person's information unless you have permission.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="public-info-note">Privacy contact: <a href="mailto:awaisshaikhcs786@gmail.com">awaisshaikhcs786@gmail.com</a>. Material policy changes will be posted here with a revised date.</p>
</section>
